flowchart TD
    %% Sources: prope_source_of_truth.md S4, MVP, Release 1, open questions; business-analysis.md FR-01.

    start([Start: Prompt Owner has an external prompt])
    entry{Entry point}
    onboarding[Onboarding]
    registry[Registry]
    source{Capture source}
    paste["[TBD Screen] Copy-Paste Capture"]
    import["[TBD Screen] Import Prompt"]
    preview[Registration Preview]
    import_failed[Unverified / TBD: Import Failed]
    details{Required details complete?\nUnverified / TBD}
    validation[Unverified / TBD: Registration Validation]
    owner["[TBD Screen] Establish Owner"]
    register[Register Prompt]
    draft[Prompt Detail - Private Draft]
    end([End: owned private Draft registered])

    start --> entry
    entry -->|First prompt| onboarding
    entry -->|Existing workspace| registry
    onboarding -->|Add your first prompt| source
    registry -->|Add prompt| source
    source -->|Copy-paste or selected text| paste
    source -->|Sheets, Notion, repository, or file| import
    paste -->|Preview| preview
    import -->|Import succeeds| preview
    import -->|Import fails| import_failed
    import_failed -->|Retry| import
    import_failed -->|Cancel| registry
    preview --> details
    details -->|No| validation
    validation -->|Complete details| preview
    details -->|Yes| owner
    owner -->|Owner establishment method is TBD| register
    register -->|Never auto-share or auto-release| draft
    draft --> end
